"description":"Give your Apple Watch a look that's all you. With more than 2,000 watch faces, from wallpapers to complications, Watch Faces & Widget Gallery lets you match your watch to your style, your day, and your mood.\n\nBrowse collections curated by theme and loved by Apple Watch fans, preview every detail, and add the face that feels like you in a few taps.\n\n\nAnd now, adding a face is smoother and more reliable than ever. Here's what you can add:\n\n• Complication faces: Built on Modular, Modular Duo, Modular Ultra, Infograph, and Meridian, they show live info such as activity, steps, heart rate, weather, and the date. Requires PRO.\n\n• Wallpaper faces: Built on the Photos watch face, they fill your display with a design you love. Many are free, and premium designs require PRO.\n\n• Complications and widgets: Add our complications to your watch faces and our widgets to the Smart Stack on Apple Watch.\n\nWhether you want something bold for the weekend, clean for the office, or sporty for your next run, you'll find a face that fits.\n\n\nWhy Watch Faces & Widget Gallery?\n\n• More than a wallpaper. Complication faces are complete watch faces with live info, while wallpaper faces set a design behind the time.\n\n• Know before you add. Every preview shows which Apple Watch models a face works with.\n\n• Always something new. Fresh faces arrive regularly, so your watch can change as often as you do.\n\n• Free to start. Download, browse, and add many wallpaper faces for free.\n\n\nRequires iPhone with iOS 17 or later and Apple Watch with watchOS 10 or later. With your permission, some complications use Health, location, and calendar data.\n\nIf you love Watch Faces & Widget Gallery, try PRO. Unlock every complication face and premium wallpaper with a weekly, monthly, or yearly subscription.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at purchase, or when a free trial ends. Your subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings. Any unused portion of a free trial, if offered, is forfeited when you subscribe.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://watchfaces.co/privacy-policy/\nTerms of Use: https://watchfaces.co/terms-and-conditions/\nContact: https://watchfaces.co/contact/", "bundleId":"com.ajtech.watchface", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.56097000000000019070967027801088988780975341796875, "languageCodesISO2A":["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "ZH", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes":"150372352", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":23700, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://watchfaces.co/", "trackId":1617064080, "trackName":"Watch Faces & Widget Gallery", "userRatingCount":23700}]
